gory" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043472/state.json" "file_sha256" "62cedba17ee9cd27695b48375206eb4673c108f56111dcb6e16396ef995fdc8d"} {"question" "q-69475" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Note that we can rewrite this integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{7\\,\\text{d}x}{|7x|\\sqrt{(7x)^{2}-1}}=7\\int \\frac{\\text{d}x}{|7x|\\sqrt{(7x)^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nThis integral now resembles the basic one for $\\text{arcsec},$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}u=\\text{arcsec}(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $7x.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=7x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=7\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{7}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}7\\int \\frac{1}{|7x|\\sqrt{(7x)^{2}-1}}\\text{d}x & =7\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{7}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\text{arcsec }u+C \\\\  & =\\text{arcsec}(7x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043472/state.json" "file_sha256" "62cedba17ee9cd27695b48375206eb4673c108f56111dcb6e16396ef995fdc8d"} {"question" "q-69475" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043472/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "dbf7756ee853b4dbb832c291311a9f74ffe3d70df412d896f974cff1a0b78c4d"} {"question" "q-69475" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043472/state.json" "file_sha256" "62cedba17ee9cd2769